  unitName: "Priestess Snow Miku (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 850297
  unitNumber: 8383
  description: A young lady gifted with a wondrous voice, it is said that she came
    to Grand Gaia in the middle of a snowstorm. She emerged from its howling heart
    with a song on her lips, the melody more than enough to quiet the storm. She
    said to those that would listen that she was looking for her friends, although
    she could not remember what they looked like. Thanks to the kind hearts of those
    who saw her, she began a journey across the land as she began her search. Soon,
    many would know her song...
  summonDesc: Come with me! We'll fly to the open skies!
  fusionDesc: I will take their prayers and make their wishes come true! Will you
    help me?
